            "url": "https://simoxdcs.github.io/2026/10/01/%E5%A4%AA%E7%99%BD%E5%B1%B1%E6%B8%B8%E8%AE%B0/",
            "title": "太白山游记",
            "date_published": "2026-10-01T05:21:47.000Z",
            "content_html": "<p>趁着中秋和国庆假期，也是和室友一块去了太白山玩，这个事很久之前就在谋划了，当时一直没有想出来要去哪里玩，又觉得光是去吃个饭然后打桌游太单调了，得去找一个能出去玩的地方，遂提议去泡温泉，大伙一听泡温泉好啊，但是上次去的那家温泉感觉就很那个，因为上次去我们的泳裤什么的全都丢了，我们放柜子里被别人全部清掉了，这就很难绷了，所以就没去那家，之后是听我室友他伙计说去太白山那边泡温泉很好，然后一想不仅可以泡温泉还可以顺便爬山，于是拍板同意了这个方案，然后我们的计划是9.26早上去吃顿自助，吃完自助就去打桌游，然后下午18点坐火车出发去眉县（也就是太白山的地方），第一天去晚上泡温泉然后第二天出发去爬山，然后第三天到宝鸡去转转然后回去。唯一可惜的是新买的手机不能在出发之前收到，只能用旧手机拍照啥的，然后第一天的时候其他计划都正常就是晚上去坐火车的时候，因为火车站是西安站就在小寨附件不远，所以我们就没着急17.51的火车我们17点差不多才从桌游店出来，本来直接去坐地铁其实时间也够了，但是有人叫的车，叫的车本来也没啥但是那会小寨那边超级堵就导致半天到不了，我们等了半天车才发现好像如果一直等车时间就不够了，这时我们改变原有计划去坐地铁，我们紧赶慢赶到地铁上发现时间超级紧张，可能留给我们的时间就只剩几分钟来进站上火车，虽然持悲观态度，但是还是想着总得试试吧，然后我们就一出地铁就开始疯狂赶路，中途因为我还没带身份证就只能用12306的临时身份证明，结果还因为没更新应用半天用不了，后面好像是和那边的工作人员说车马上开了然后给他看了车票就放我进去了，有一个快速进站口，但是左右都有进站的地方，我在二则中选错了方向，导致我绕着那个小的进站大厅跑了一整圈才到站台，好在这时候时间还够，火车还没开，然后我进去就又开始疯狂赶路，等到上到火车上我已经几乎站不稳了，上去之后看到他们几个也是都快站不稳了，我们又往前走过好长一截车厢才到我们的位置，等我们坐下都直接瘫在座位上了，缓了好久才缓过来，后面去太白山的时候玩的还不错，就是因为人太少了就导致温泉是烧的开水，烧开水就烧开水吧反正泡着也挺舒服的，不过那边太白山景区里有好多烂尾楼啊，真滴夸张，等我们回来总结了一下发现大部分的花销都在景区门票上和宾馆上了，不过总的来说玩的还是很开心的，我们每天晚上都去阿伟那边用他的ns连电视然后一起玩他的那个马里奥排队，真是快乐的三天，下面就放一些拍摄的图片吧</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/00.jpg\" alt=\"00\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/01.jpg\" alt=\"01\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/02.jpg\" alt=\"02\" /><br />\n这三张是第一天晚上去的时候拍的，那会还赶上了喷泉表演，怪不赖的。</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/03.jpg\" alt=\"03\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/04.jpg\" alt=\"04\" /><br />\n这是在阿伟那边玩的那个马里奥派对小游戏</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/05.jpg\" alt=\"05\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/06.jpg\" alt=\"06\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/07.jpg\" alt=\"07\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/09.jpg\" alt=\"09\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/11.jpg\" alt=\"11\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/12.jpg\" alt=\"12\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/13.jpg\" alt=\"13\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/14.jpg\" alt=\"14\" /><br />\n因为有点爬不动，我们就一路坐车上去的，这边的车每到一个地方就会给我们放下来看看那一处有啥东西，还挺好的</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/15.jpg\" alt=\"15\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/16.jpg\" alt=\"16\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/17.jpg\" alt=\"17\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/18.jpg\" alt=\"18\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/19.jpg\" alt=\"19\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/20.jpg\" alt=\"20\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/21.jpg\" alt=\"21\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/22.jpg\" alt=\"22\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/23.jpg\" alt=\"23\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/24.jpg\" alt=\"24\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/25.jpg\" alt=\"25\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/26.jpg\" alt=\"26\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/27.jpg\" alt=\"27\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/28.jpg\" alt=\"28\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/29.jpg\" alt=\"29\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/30.jpg\" alt=\"30\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/31.jpg\" alt=\"31\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/32.jpg\" alt=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/34.jpg\" alt=\"34\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/35.jpg\" alt=\"35\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/36.jpg\" alt=\"36\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/37.jpg\" alt=\"37\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/38.jpg\" alt=\"38\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/39.jpg\" alt=\"39\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/40.jpg\" alt=\"40\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/41.jpg\" alt=\"41\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/42.jpg\" alt=\"42\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/43.jpg\" alt=\"43\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/44.jpg\" alt=\"44\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/45.jpg\" alt=\"45\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/46.jpg\" alt=\"46\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/47.jpg\" alt=\"47\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/48.jpg\" alt=\"48\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/49.jpg\" alt=\"49\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/50.jpg\" alt=\"50\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/51.jpg\" alt=\"51\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/52.jpg\" alt=\"52\" /><br />\n之后我们就坐索道上去了，爬不动山了于是直接买了上下的索道的票，按理说研究生是买不了学生票的，但是偷偷买了学生票检票口那边也没有检查的很严，直接给我放过去了哈哈哈哈哈。</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/53.jpg\" alt=\"53\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/54.jpg\" alt=\"54\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/55.jpg\" alt=\"55\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/56.jpg\" alt=\"56\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/57.jpg\" alt=\"57\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/58.jpg\" alt=\"58\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/59.jpg\" alt=\"59\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/60.jpg\" alt=\"60\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/61.jpg\" alt=\"61\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/62.jpg\" alt=\"62\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/63.jpg\" alt=\"63\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/64.jpg\" alt=\"64\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/65.jpg\" alt=\"65\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/66.jpg\" alt=\"66\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/67.jpg\" alt=\"67\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/68.jpg\" alt=\"68\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/69.jpg\" alt=\"69\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/70.jpg\" alt=\"70\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/71.jpg\" alt=\"71\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/72.jpg\" alt=\"72\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/73.jpg\" alt=\"73\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/74.jpg\" alt=\"74\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/75.jpg\" alt=\"75\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/76.jpg\" alt=\"76\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/77.jpg\" alt=\"77\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/78.jpg\" alt=\"78\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/79.jpg\" alt=\"79\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/80.jpg\" alt=\"80\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/81.jpg\" alt=\"81\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/82.jpg\" alt=\"82\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/83.jpg\" alt=\"83\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/84.jpg\" alt=\"84\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/85.jpg\" alt=\"85\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/86.jpg\" alt=\"86\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/88.jpg\" alt=\"88\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/89.jpg\" alt=\"89\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/90.jpg\" alt=\"90\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/91.jpg\" alt=\"91\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/92.jpg\" alt=\"92\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/93.jpg\" alt=\"93\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/94.jpg\" alt=\"94\" /><br />\n之后就是坐索道到山顶上了，虽然海拔只有3500多，但是上去之后走两步就感觉有点喘气，海拔高的反应还是挺明显的，吼吼夸藏偶。</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/96.jpg\" alt=\"96\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/simoxdcs/csgo@v4.0/youji/3/97.jpg\" alt=\"97\" /><br />\n再后面就是第三天去宝鸡转的了，我们去了一个西府老街，然后吃了牛子说了四年的豆花泡馍哈哈哈，还买了炒豆腐吃，豆花泡馍的辣油真的很香，味道感觉还可以，抄豆腐感觉就一般般了，不是很好吃，之后就回去了，就是过来玩的时候还在被催之前的那个试飞院的项目的事情，有点烦。</p>\n",
